, cutting heads, and welding heads in fiber laser systems. Sourced directly from the OEM manufacturer, this QBH connector is rigorously quality-checked to deliver superior performance and durability. Trust NKL Laser to provide this essential component, guaranteeing uninterrupted operation and optimal cutting efficiency for your industrial requirements.","specs":["Size/Spec: 12x13, 4KW","Direct Importer: NKL Laser Genuine Spares","Tested for Durability & High Laser Damage Threshold"],"specificationsTable":[{"label":"Brand","value":"IPG"},{"label":"Category","value":"QBH Protection Cap"},{"label":"Part / Model","value":"IPG QBH I 12x13 (4KW)"},{"label":"Size / Dimensions","value":"12x13, 4KW"},{"label":"Laser Power Rating","value":"Universal"},{"label":"Compatibility","value":"NKL Laser, IPG"},{"label":"Quality Assurance","value":"100% Quality Checked by NKL Laser"}],"brand":"NKL Laser / IPG","compatibleBrands":["NKL Laser","IPG"],"powerRange":"Universal","stockStatus":"In Stock","inStock":true,"isPopular":true,"isFeatured":false,"regularPrice":12000,"salePrice":6999,"estimatedPrice":6999,"originalUrl":"https://www.NKL Laser.in/products/ipg-qbh-12x13-4kw","moq":1,"guid":"cf43d96f-0ca5-4886-89fb-1709cb710b49"}');
