r Cutting Machines. Designed with ergonomic finesse, its intuitive interface ensures effortless operation, while wireless connectivity offers freedom of movement. Fine-tune parameters and execute intricate designs with precision, thanks to its responsive controls. Compatible with a wide range of laser cutting machines, it seamlessly integrates into your workflow, enhancing productivity and safety. Built to withstand industrial demands, its durability guarantees long-lasting performance. With easy setup and essential safety features, the Bodor Black Remote Controller is your go-to solution for optimizing laser cutting operations.","specs":["Direct Importer: NKL Laser Genuine Spares","Tested for Durability & High Laser Damage Threshold"],"specificationsTable":[{"label":"Brand","value":"Bodor"},{"label":"Category","value":"Remote Controller"},{"label":"Part / Model","value":"Bodor Black Remote Controller"},{"label":"Laser Power Rating","value":"Universal"},{"label":"Compatibility","value":"NKL Laser, Bodor"},{"label":"Quality Assurance","value":"100% Quality Checked by NKL Laser"}],"brand":"NKL Laser / Bodor","compatibleBrands":["NKL Laser","Bodor"],"powerRange":"Universal","stockStatus":"In Stock","inStock":true,"isPopular":false,"isFeatured":false,"regularPrice":22000,"salePrice":16999,"estimatedPrice":16999,"originalUrl":"https://www.NKL Laser.in/products/bodor-black-remote-controller","moq":1,"guid":"30ecb1ba-1dda-4553-bc08-07a02ff1cd4f"}');
